    <briefdescription>
<para>Frame layout, frame types, payload prefixes and byte-order helpers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The wire format is described in <computeroutput>docs/protocol.md</computeroutput>: <computeroutput>SYNC | DST | SRC | CTRL | LEN | PAYLOAD[LEN] | CRC16 (big endian)</computeroutput>, CRC-16/CCITT-FALSE over DST..PAYLOAD, <computeroutput>CTRL = TYPE[7:6] | FIRST[5] | reserved[4] | SEQ[3:0]</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
